an class=\"italic\">x</span> drinks and <span class=\"italic\">y</span> salads are bought at the food truck. No information is provided about the number of drinks or the number of salads that are bought during the day. Therefore, 7.00 doesn&rsquo;t represent either of these quantities.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n","answer_style":"Multiple Choice","section":"Math","image_count":7,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1691007959619,"pPcc":"SAT#H","questionId":"b9839f9e","skill_cd":"H.C.","score_band_range_cd":2,"skill_desc":"Linear equations in two variables","createDate":1691007959619,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Algebra","ibn":"025710-DC","external_id":null,"primary_class_cd":"H","uId":"d4e9ed1c-a20f-4a09-8937-b6239d5df149","difficulty":"E"},"raw_detail":{"item_id":"025710-DC","section":"Math","body":"<div class=\"stimulus_reference \" xmlns=\"http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/apip/apipv1p0/qtiitem/imsqti_v2p1\"><p class=\"standalone_statement style:1 \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"F equals, 2 point 5 0 x, plus 7 point 0 0 y\"></span></span></p></div>\n","prompt":"<p class=\"stem_paragraph \">In the equation above, <span class=\"italic\">F</span> represents the total amount of money, in dollars, a food truck charges for <span class=\"italic\">x </span>drinks and <span class=\"italic\">y</span> salads. The price, in dollars, of each drink is the same, and the price, in dollars, of each salad is the same. Which of the following is the best interpretation for the number 7.00 in this context?</p>\n","answer":{"style":"Multiple Choice","choices":{"a":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">The price, in dollars, of one drink</p>\n"},"b":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">The price, in dollars, of one salad</p>\n"},"c":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">The number of drinks bought during the day</p>\n"},"d":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">